    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-ambystoma-mexicanum-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-v2-delphi10000-ambystoma-mexicanum-turing-wavelength-s0-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-ambystoma-mexicanum-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-v2-delphi10000-ambystoma-mexicanum-turing-wavelength-s0-10>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-ambystoma-mexicanum-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-v2-delphi10000-ambystoma-mexicanum-turing-wavelength-s0-11>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-ambystoma-mexicanum-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-v2-delphi10000-ambystoma-mexicanum-turing-wavelength-s0-12>,
