        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-ambystoma-mexicanum-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-v2-delphi10000-ambystoma-mexicanum-turing-wavelength-s0-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-ambystoma-mexicanum-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-v2-delphi10000-ambystoma-mexicanum-turing-wavelength-s0-3>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-ambystoma-mexicanum-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-v2-delphi10000-ambystoma-mexicanum-turing-wavelength-s0-4>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-ambystoma-mexicanum-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-v2-delphi10000-ambystoma-mexicanum-turing-wavelength-s0-5>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-ambystoma-mexicanum-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-v2-delphi10000-ambystoma-mexicanum-turing-wavelength-s0-6>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-ambystoma-mexicanum-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-v2-delphi10000-ambystoma-mexicanum-turing-wavelength-s0-7>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-ambystoma-mexicanum-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-v2-delphi10000-ambystoma-mexicanum-turing-wavelength-s0-8>,
